Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.48,0:00:03.64,TL,,0,0,337,,{\an2}{\fs46}From the depths of despair,{\fs68}\N从绝境里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:08.44,TL,,0,0,337,,{\an2}{\fs46}De Minaur finds a way.{\fs68}\N德米纳尔找到了出路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.44,0:00:10.80,TL,,0,0,337,,{\an2}{\fs46}Team World are in the lead.{\fs68}\N世界队领先了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:13.37,TL,,0,0,0,,兹维列夫今年拿下法网和美网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.37,0:00:14.63,TL,,0,0,0,,世界第{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.63,0:00:16.85,TL,,0,0,0,,可去年在旧金山的拉沃尔杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.85,0:00:19.99,TL,,0,0,0,,德米纳尔{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}赢过他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.65,0:00:24.37,TL,,0,0,0,,北京时间{\fs78}9{\fs68}月{\fs78}26{\fs68}号晚上{\fs78}10{\fs68}点多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.37,0:00:26.34,TL,,0,0,0,,拉沃尔杯第二天第二场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.86,TL,,0,0,0,,第一盘兹维列夫一记正手制胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:30.23,TL,,0,0,0,,两次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.23,0:00:32.34,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}的盘点 他兑现了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:34.95,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}37{\fs68}分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.05,0:00:36.33,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.33,0:00:38.95,TL,,0,0,0,,兹维列夫又拿到{\fs78}3{\fs68}个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.95,0:00:41.07,TL,,0,0,0,,第三个兑现 {\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.07,0:00:43.45,TL,,0,0,0,,接着保发 {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.85,0:00:49.39,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 兹维列夫发球胜赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.39,0:00:51.60,TL,,0,0,0,,却被德米纳尔破了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.60,0:00:54.17,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 抢七 第一分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.17,0:00:55.61,TL,,0,0,0,,德米纳尔就拿下了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.61,0:00:58.05,TL,,0,0,0,,阿加西在场边站了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.85,0:01:03.23,TL,,0,0,0,,抢七{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 德米纳尔又拿到盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.23,0:01:07.02,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次他兑现了 {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} {\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:11.62,TL,,0,0,337,,{\an2}{\fs46}Oh, he's got himself back in it.{\fs68}\N他把自己拉回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:15.70,TL,,0,0,337,,{\an2}{\fs46}The grit and determination of De Minaur{\fs68}\N德米纳尔的韧劲和决心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.70,0:01:19.20,TL,,0,0,337,,{\an2}{\fs46}has leveled the match at one set apiece.{\fs68}\N把比分扳成一比一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:21.68,TL,,0,0,0,,抢{\fs78}10{\fs68}兹维列夫先拿三分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.68,0:01:23.76,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}比{\fs78}8{\fs68} 拿到赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:25.72,TL,,0,0,0,,可这一分他打得太保守
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.72,0:01:29.40,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一拍 出了边线 九平
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.30,0:01:34.32,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}比{\fs78}9{\fs68} 轮到德米纳尔的赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:35.73,TL,,0,0,0,,一个很长的回合
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.73,0:01:37.58,TL,,0,0,0,,他被兹维列夫左右调动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.58,0:01:40.39,TL,,0,0,0,,一次次滑到角上把球救回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.39,0:01:43.30,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一拍 兹维列夫没打进
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.70,0:01:48.92,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}11{\fs68}比{\fs78}9{\fs68} 两小时零三分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:51.56,TL,,0,0,0,,阿加西在场边 笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.50,0:02:03.18,TL,,0,0,337,,{\an2}{\fs46}What an extraordinary point to finish.{\fs68}\N最后这一分 太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.18,0:02:04.20,TL,,0,0,337,,{\an2}{\fs46}And what a fighter that Alex is.{\fs68}\N亚历克斯真是个斗士
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.30,0:02:06.26,TL,,0,0,0,,世界队{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}反超
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:08.22,TL,,0,0,0,,晚上阿尔卡拉斯对弗里茨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.22,0:02:09.85,TL,,0,0,0,,去年输给他的那一场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.85,0:02:11.88,TL,,0,0,0,,今年讨得回来吗？
